    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Centrally Located Three Bedroom Semi Detached Bungalow\r\n\r\nKinsella Estates Carnew & Gorey are delighted to present this attractive three-bedroom semi-detached bungalow located on the highly sought-after Coolattin Road, Carnew, Co. Wicklow. Ideally positioned within walking distance of Carnew village and its excellent range of local amenities, this charming residence offers the perfect balance of convenience, comfort and countryside living.\r\n\r\nNestled in the scenic surroundings of Co. Wicklow, this delightful home offers an exceptional opportunity for first-time buyers, families or those seeking to downsize without compromising on space or location. The property has been thoughtfully maintained and boasts bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: A warm and welcoming entrance hall featuring attractive timber flooring and decorative coving, setting the tone for the well-maintained accommodation throughout.\r\nLiving Room: A bright and inviting reception room complete with timber flooring, decorative coving, a charming cast iron fireplace incorporating a solid fuel stove, creating a cosy and comfortable living space.\r\nKitchen / Dining Room: A generously proportioned kitchen and dining area designed for everyday family living. Features include tiled splash back, chrome extractor vent, and a rear door providing direct access to the garden. Conservatory: A wonderful addition to the home, flooded with natural light and featuring double doors opening onto the raised decking area, creating the perfect space for relaxing or entertaining while enjoying views of the rear garden.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: A spacious and well-appointed principal bedroom featuring timber flooring, built-in wardrobe and decorative coving. Bedroom 2: A generous double bedroom with timber flooring, built-in wardrobe and decorative coving. Bedroom 3: A bright and versatile bedroom finished with timber flooring, ideal as a child's bedroom, guest room or home office. Shower Room: \r\nA contemporary fully tiled shower room complete with Triton electric shower, offering both practicality and style. Bathroom; A fully tiled family bathroom, thoughtfully designed for everyday comfort.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor: Office: A versatile room ideally suited as a home office, study or hobby room.\r\nGames Room, A spacious additional room offering a variety of potential uses, including a games room, recreation area or further storage space.\r\n\r\nOutside: To the rear, the property benefits from a south facing private decking area accessed directly from the conservatory, providing an ideal setting for outdoor dining and entertaining. The garden also includes two useful storage sheds, offering excellent additional storage for garden equipment and outdoor essentials.\r\n\r\nCombining a peaceful setting with the convenience of village amenities just moments away, this appealing home presents a wonderful opportunity to enjoy comfortable living in one of North Wicklow's most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nBER: E, 119646586\r\nEir Code: Y14 A625\r\nHouse Size: 118.72 mt. sq (1,278 Sq. ft.)\r\nFolio No: WW12118"
      },
